Conductor OSS is an independent local-first control surface for coding agents.
The project is inspired by prior open-source agent Kanban and coding-agent
orchestration tools, including Vibe Kanban by BloopAI
(https://github.com/BloopAI/vibe-kanban), which is licensed under the Apache
License 2.0.

This notice is provided to make product lineage and inspiration explicit. If a
future audit identifies file-level source copied from another project, preserve
that project's copyright and license notice next to the affected files.
